{"id": "68911", "title": "重生之一世一花", "author": "二小七", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 32, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68911.htm", "intro": "家人的无视，丈夫的漠视；\r\n 最后发现的真相，濒临死亡的醒悟；\r\n 无法改变他人，就只能改变自己。\r\n 一花一世界，一木一浮生，\r\n 一草一天堂，一叶一如来，\r\n 一砂一极乐，一方一净土，\r\n 一笑一尘缘，一念一清静。\r\n 双手握无限， 刹那是永恒，活得自我，活的洒脱；\r\n 才不枉轮回一次琉璃般铮铮佼佼的一生；\r\n 我是人间肆意客，人间自由皆随心；\r\n 书卷永海，铮铮离人；\r\n 我是书璃铮。\r\n 收藏此文章★～点我收藏我吧～★\r\n 此文入V，请盗文者自重，尊重原著作者。如果实在是要盗，请自觉推后两章，谢谢合作！\r\n 小二练手文，戳戳：\r\n 小二的动漫同人文，戳戳：\r\n 小二的另一篇空间重生文，戳戳：\r\n 小二的另一篇动漫同人文，戳戳：\r\n 小二的另一篇真人同人文，戳戳：", "base": "files/article/html/68/68911", "chapters": [{"title": "第 1 章", "file": "10551176.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 2 章", "file": "10551177.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 3 章", "file": "10551178.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 4 章", "file": "10551179.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 5 章", "file": "10551180.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 6 章", "file": "10551181.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 7 章", "file": "10551182.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 8 章", "file": "10551183.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 9 章", "file": "10551184.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 10 章", "file": "10551185.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 11 章", "file": "10551186.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 12 章", "file": "10551187.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 13 章", "file": "10551188.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 14 章", "file": "10551189.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 15 章", "file": "10551190.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 16 章", "file": "10551191.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 17 章", "file": "10551192.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 18 章", "file": "10551193.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 19 章", "file": "10551194.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 20 章", "file": "10551195.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 21 章", "file": "10551196.html", "available": false}, {"titl